  "prefLabel": "Puc 202.09 Hearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 202.09 “Hearing” means a publicly noticed session held in a matter before the commission or its designee, which provides an opportunity for any participant, party, or intervenor to present evidence, conduct cross-examination, or otherwise participate.\n\nSource. #14184, eff 1-24-25",
